        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jayaraj, William Shakespeare, Narain\n- Films: Vidyarambham, Johnnie Walker, Kudumbasametham, Paithrukam, Highway, Desadanam, Kaliyattam, Karunam, Shantham, Kannaki, 4 the People, By The People, Daivanamathil, Makalkku, Adbhutam, Gulmohar, Loudspeaker, Pakarnnattam, Ottaal, Veeram\n- Projects: Navarasa series\n- Topics: Malayalam cinema, film adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- Jayaraj's notable films include Vidyarambham (1990), Johnnie Walker (1992), Kudumbasametham (1992), Paithrukam (1993), Highway (1995), Desadanam (1996), Kaliyattam (1997), Karunam (2000), Shantham (2000), Kannaki (2002), 4 the People (2004), Daivanamathil (2005), Makalkku (2005), Adbhutam (2006), Gulmohar (2008), Loudspeaker (2009), Pakarnnattam (2012), Ottaal (2015), and Veeram (2017).\n- By The People is a 2005 Malayalam film directed by Jayaraj and starring Narain.\n- Veeram is a 2016 Indian epic historical drama film written and directed by Jayaraj.\n- Veeram is an adaptation of William Shakespeare's play Macbeth.\n- Veeram is the fifth installment in Jayaraj's Navarasa series.",
